/Title (Let me underline this for emphasis: The average team in this group, when faced with any type of real basketball game, is playing as bad as the worst team in history \(the 7-59 Charlotte Bobcats during the lockout-shortened 2011-12 season\), posting a despicable .106 winning percentage that equates to an 8.7-win season over 82 games, with nearly the worst scoring margin in NBA history.)
/Dest [16 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 6 0 R
/Prev 300 0 R
/Next 296 0 R
>>
